<section class="shell band">
  <p class="eyebrow">Continuing education for Texas counselors</p>
  <h1>Ethics CEUs</h1>
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Texas LPCs need <strong>24 hours of continuing education</strong> each renewal period,
    at least <strong>6 of them in ethics</strong>. Reem Glasco, LPC-S, offers ethics continuing
    education in two formats: <strong>one CEU online</strong>, or <strong>two CEUs in
    person</strong>, held on a trail walk among horses near Dripping Springs. The subject is
    <strong>secondary trauma</strong>: what this work does to the people who do it, and where
    the ethical obligations actually sit.</p>
  </div>
